# ---- Editors / OS ----
# .claude/ is local agent tooling, not part of the project: it holds machine
# paths in settings.local.json, and ignoring the directory rather than that one
# file is what keeps a `git add -A` from publishing whatever lands there next.
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---- Logs / temp ----
*.log
